<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-17T14:19:25.509Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:19:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces used drones and CCTV to stop a terrorist attack in Riyom, while gunmen killed a traditional ruler in Plateau and murdered four vigilantes there. In Plateau, gunmen also stormed a mining site, killing two people, and killed a monarch at his home. Bandits besieged a Kaduna estate, forcing residents to flee, and abducted a pregnant woman, her husband and their six-month-old daughter, demanding a large ransom. Catholic priest John Otache was abducted in Benue, prompting police deployment for his rescue. A nurse died after an asthma attack at a federal hospital amid claims of emergency care failures. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDc5aGstcVFvYWxpRlczSEVzOUtWWUxOY3hTWGZZTlBPZDRYcV8zMEJEVDM2cGJlUkc3YmNiYkFJdVFhdzNHUVBIOS1rbmkyUjZOTWo2Y2lhUVNJMUxDd0hUNmtTb3A1S3NOdTB0RHJXcGxiRUd4aU5lU3daUkdUeEx5bE42di0wYzJLMndsbVFwVjVTN21HdVZkOHplRi01bkVIN1BrMkJMSFozX250eWtB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPcFZtNFNEN2JfMWRJaVE3RTFYY21mdlFtYmNSM2pWRkdpRU5COVZ0Q2lFT3ZHUXRQd2tYU2o2b0VYMjFiRXBtZWhiU2cyZThLQ0kzVW1DNHFoNWlLNkZFMEs1TzVaQ1hfLUFJMENBa3VvVmxDTzZxSFA2QmhSV24weVZYWDhSQnc1Tmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPRUM0VXhwX2VOeTM2UzNsWDF1cUZwbWl0Q05PMXNIQUNTLTZfVjQ5U2JhaVNJOUJXSFlJVjNsdDNSWHQ2RjByV2dSZFowc3FNQkZtRW9LSWpmNHR6UGlSbmVfQl9WNzBKbzAySGNiU1JESW9jYm1NQUpFelBRZ09Tdm81dk5RTGhvYjJYRVBR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPR3lvMTJNci1uX01jN0YxNy1FQ1hCOGRNbVU5eFgxY2IzVzNzQl